### Description

This mod was designed to enhance parking spots, lights and apron lighting at LHSimulations LHBP Budapest International Airport (available at Marketplace only).
For Microsoft Flight Simulator 2024, use this file instead:

https://flightsim.to/file/94185/lhsimulations-lhbp-budapest-lighting-parking-enhancements
LHSimulations has done a great job at recreating Ferenc Liszt International Airport for MSFS but, unfortunately, this scenery has some drawbacks:

- Missing parking spots such as Gates 34L, 34R, 35L, 35R, 36L, 36R, R110, R112, R114, R116, etc;
- Incorrect taxiway names;
- Inappropriate parking radius for AI traffic;
- Incorrect assignment of airline parking codes;
- Dark aprons at night;
- Unreal green centerline lights on some taxiways;

After hours and hours watching live streams and tracking real planes at Budapest International Airport with FlightRadar24.com, it was possible to determine with accuracy the exact location where each aircraft type / airline park.  
